ntext, not guessed\\n    wait_for_pattern: \\\"ready|listening|started on port\\\",\\n    terminal_name: \\\"Dev Server\\\"\\n  }\\n})\\n```\\n\\nThe tool returns as soon as the pattern matches. The server keeps running. Track its PID with `list_processes`.\"}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "chatcmpl-tool-ac373b4c9dcb0162", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "workspace_ops", "arguments": "{\"action\":\"list_dir\",\"mode\":\"preview\",\"payload\":{\"path\":\"c:\\\\Users\\\\mohit\\\\Desktop\\\\python\\\\TESTING_VERTEX_SWARM\\\\frontend\"},\"request_id\":\"list_frontend_root\"}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ac373b4c9dcb0162", "content": "{\"status\": \"success\", \"content\": \".git/\\n.gitignore\\n.next/\\nAGENTS.md\\nCLAUDE.md\\nnext-env.d.ts\\nnext.config.ts\\nnode_modules/\\npackage-lock.json\\npackage.json\\npages/\\npostcss.config.mjs\\npublic/\\nREADME.md\\nstyles/\\ntsconfig.json\"}"}], "stream": true, "tools": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "workspace_ops", "description": "Perform one workspace operation against the repository.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"action": {"type": "string", "enum": ["list_dir", "search_text", "read_file", "edit_file", "create_file", "delete_path", "rename_path"]}, "request_id": {"type": "string", "description": "Stable idempotency key for retries of the same tool call."}, "mode": {"type": "string", "enum": ["preview", "apply"], "description": "Use 'preview' to see what would happen, 'apply' to execute the change."}, "payload": {"type": "object", "description": "Arguments for the action.", "properties": {"path": {"type": "string", "description": "The file or directory path. Use '.' or '/' for the root directory."}, "query": {"type": "string", "description": "The text or regex inside file contents to search for. Required for search_text."}, "variants": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}, "description": "Semantic synonyms to impro